+# Bug Fix: Inventory is not reserved, restored, or exposed consistently
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T00:00:00+00:00
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Inventory validation now happens before checkout payment/order persistence, checkout resolves products by SKU and decrements the exact ordered quantities, and insufficient stock uses HTTP 409. Cart creation and updates validate the complete resulting cart before saving, cancellation restores stock once and blocks later status changes, and v2 product output reflects positive stock.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/order/OrderServiceImpl.java` | modified | Pre-validates all checkout lines and decrements by ordered SKU rather than order-product id. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/shoppingCart/facade/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Validates stock for add, single update, and multi-update paths before persistence. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Restocks on first cancellation and rejects status changes after cancellation. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/populator/catalog/ReadableProductPopulator.java` | modified | Sets availability and purchasability false at zero stock. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/exception/InventoryConflictException.java` | added | Dedicated 409 conflict exception. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/exception/RestErrorHandler.java` | modified | Maps inventory conflicts to HTTP 409. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Preserves inventory conflicts through checkout handling. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartApi.java` | modified | Preserves inventory conflicts through cart handling. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No new automated test classes were added; existing module tests were used for compilation/regression checks.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `git diff --check` → passed.
+- Commands run: `mvn -q -pl sm-core,sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed.
+- Manual checks: reviewed all requested endpoint paths and the status transition logic.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The implementation uses order history/current status as the cancellation idempotency marker rather than adding a schema column. A dedicated conflict exception was added to preserve the requested 409 response through the existing controller exception wrappers.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add database-backed integration tests covering concurrent checkout and multi-line cancellation rollback.
