+| Standalone focused test | `mvn -q -pl sm-core -Dtest=OrderTest test` | not-run | Maven could not resolve local reactor artifact descriptors and received 401 from `repo.spring.io`. |
+| Lint / type-check | `git diff --check` | pass | No whitespace errors. |
