+
+## Residual Risks
+
+- Concurrent checkout race behavior and full transaction rollback were not validated by the available tests.
+- Cancellation and v2 zero-stock response behavior still need dedicated API assertions.
+
+## Recommendation
+
+Hold for targeted inventory integration tests covering checkout, cart conflict atomicity, cancellation idempotency, and product flags; the available focused regression checks pass.
